                        {
                            "text": "Vroeger stonden er op het platteland houten <w>mikken</w> om het geoogste graan te ondersteunen.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "In the past, there were wooden <w>forked stakes</w> in the countryside to support the harvested grain."
                            }
